00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:23.750 align:start position:0%
the oe refrigerator is a fridge that  combines the european aesthetics with  the chinese feature benefits now this  fridge aims to be sitting in the living  room the flex store of the fridge  actually allows for customization so  that consumers can actually play around  with the interior  one of the things that we really wanted  to do was differentiate ourselves  visually so that consumers can see our  product from a distance this was done  with the creation of the curved glass  door and the rounded corners we used  glass instead of metal to represent the  door fronts and this was aimed to make  it more interior fit with the consumers  homes and not just an object that was  placed anywhere in the kitchen  the brief was given to us from our  marketing team and with that brief we  actually worked with the r d department  the marketing department as well as the  design department we've kind of looked  at what are the  constraints that we have in the product  and how we would then work around those  constraints from a creation in terms of  a concept right up to a finished product  the biggest challenges when designing  the user interface is when working on  the proximity sensor how do we actually  design the proximity sensor so that it  looks discrete and beautiful from a  distance without sacrificing or  compromising the performance sensing  performance  it is very encouraging to see that  singapore recognizes designs and  designers that are from singapore it  raises the bar of design standards in  singapore and allowing more mncs to  really come into singapore and at least  recognize the contribution that we can  give to the global community  my advice to emerging designers would be  to have a keen sense of observation and  that can help you create new and  interesting ideas for future  this is the oe refrigerator design of  the year  you
 

